0 FILE 21029 - Buckingham Palace.ldr
0 The complete Buckingham Palace model consisting of a large base built from black and dark bluish grey plates with tan architectural detailing, a printed name tile, and multiple submodels forming the palace wings, facade details, decorative windows, and roof structures.
0 Name: 21029 - Buckingham Palace.ldr
0 Author: Damien Roux [Darats]
